# Table-free periodic ellipsoid mobility + compact bridge v4
plugin load ${slurry_plugin}
units si
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style ellipsoid
atom_modify map array
read_data particles.data
comm_modify vel yes
pair_style zero 1.5000000000000002e-07
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 3.0000000000000004e-08 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 9.9999999999999995e-07
fix shear all deform 0 xz erate 100 remap v units box
fix hydro all slurry/bridge 0.01 100 1.0000000000000001e-09 100 contact 1e-08 0.3 80 shape spheroid mobility_backend mesh spectral 2 spectral_tolerance 1e-08 tolerance 9.9999999999999995e-07 iterations 1000 rough_hydro 9.0000000000000012e-09 4.5000000000000006e-08 0.78000000000000003 rotation_contact 0.3 0.10000000000000001 3e-6 4.5000000000000006e-08 9e-10 1.6200000000000002e-13 history history.csv 1 0
compute shape all property/atom shapex shapey shapez quatw quati quatj quatk angmomx angmomy angmomz
dump trajectory all custom 1 trajectory.lammpstrj id type x y z vx vy vz c_shape[*] f_hydro[*]
dump_modify trajectory sort id format float %.17g
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step time atoms f_hydro[1] f_hydro[2] f_hydro[3] f_hydro[4]
thermo_modify flush yes lost error
run 20
write_data final.data nocoeff
